{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ICHORLESS</i></strong> is an RPG where you play as a modern-day human, mysteriously pulled into ancient Greece to fulfill a prophecy that\u2019s supposed to save the gods!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey home, you\u2019ll face Gods,\u00a0 Demigods, Monsters, Mortals, and Titans in a mythic world overflowing with danger, drama, and just a bit of absurdity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat, or gain the favor of a god to earn their <strong><i>Blessing!</i></strong>\u2014unique powers that completely change how you battle the next divine challenger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got Apollo\u2019s Blessing? Great! <i>If you want, you can turn every single boss fight into a singing showdown. </i>Prefer puzzles? Survival challenges? Bullet-hell shooting? Classic turn-based strategy? Fighting games?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>You decide how to enjoy this adventure!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape not just your gaming experience\u2026 but the fate of Greece itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0An Original, <strong><i><u>Fully-Composed Soundtrack</u></i></strong> to immerse you in the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong><i><u>Innovative Battle Mechanics</u></i></strong> that keep every encounter fresh and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Branching Storylines with <strong><i><u>Over 50 Unique Endings</u></i></strong> shaped entirely by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Witty Humor and Clever <strong><i><u>Nods to Mythology for fans of legendary tales.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 <strong><i><u>20+ Reason Battles\u00a0</u></i></strong>\u2014master all and forge your own path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- And <strong><i>Countless Surprises</i></strong> waiting to be discovered!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WISHLIST THE GAME!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Live on Kickstarter!:\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993890?t=1772244184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993890?t=1772244184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993890/49d158e5711bb162ca7083e37f58cf03cb232429/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772244184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993890/49d158e5711bb162ca7083e37f58cf03cb232429/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772244184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ICHORLESS</i></strong> is an RPG where you play as a modern-day human, mysteriously pulled into ancient Greece to fulfill a prophecy that\u2019s supposed to save the gods!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey home, you\u2019ll face Gods,\u00a0 Demigods, Monsters, Mortals, and Titans in a mythic world overflowing with danger, drama, and just a bit of absurdity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat, or gain the favor of a god to earn their <strong><i>Blessing!</i></strong>\u2014unique powers that completely change how you battle the next divine challenger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got Apollo\u2019s Blessing? Great! <i>If you want, you can turn every single boss fight into a singing showdown. </i>Prefer puzzles? Survival challenges? Bullet-hell shooting? Classic turn-based strategy? Fighting games?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>You decide how to enjoy this adventure!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_